  "bodyHash": "O5097mGHd8s=",
  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Solar Flux Reborn 添加了可生成 FE 或 RF 能量的太阳能板。</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/versions/246974_all.svg\" width=\"456\" height=\"18\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>核心模组包含 8 种不同等级的太阳能板（完全可配置！）</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>同时允许你创建<span style=\"color:#800000\">自定义面板</span>，可自定义材质、名称和 FE 生成速率！请阅读 /.minecraft/config/solarflux/custom_panels.js 或观看教程视频！</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>请注意，本模组还与以下模组兼容：</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/projects/223565\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://curseforge.zeith.org/api/v2/logo?id=223565\" alt=\"\" width=\"96\" height=\"32\">龙之进化</strong></a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/projects/223628\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://curseforge.zeith.org/api/v2/logo?id=223628\" alt=\"\" width=\"49\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;神秘时代</strong></a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/projects/261348\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://curseforge.zeith.org/api/v2/logo?id=261348\" alt=\"\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;无尽贪婪</strong></a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/projects/227639\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://curseforge.zeith.org/api/v2/logo?id=227639\" alt=\"\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;暮色森林</strong></a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/projects/223794\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://curseforge.zeith.org/api/v2/logo?id=223794\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"> 应用能源2</strong></a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/projects/261061\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://curseforge.zeith.org/api/v2/logo?id=261061\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"> 黑洞存储</strong></a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/projects/237664\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://curseforge.zeith.org/api/v2/logo?id=237664\" alt=\"\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"> 铁熔炉</strong></a></span></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#f00\">1.14.4 版本不兼容 Java 11。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#f00\">1.16.5 版本不兼容 Java 17。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong>模组内容：</strong></span></h3><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>方块：</strong></span></p><p><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/sp_1.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;太阳能板 I</p><ul>\n<li>生成：1 FE/tick</li>\n<li>传输：8 FE/tick</li>\n<li>容量：25,000 FE</li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/sp_2.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;太阳能板 II</p><ul>\n<li>生成：8 FE/tick</li>\n<li>传输：64 FE/tick</li>\n<li>容量：125,000 FE</li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/sp_3.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;太阳能板 III</p><ul>\n<li>生成：32 FE/tick</li>\n<li>传输：256 FE/tick</li>\n<li>容量：425,000 FE</li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/sp_4.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;太阳能板 IV</p><ul>\n<li>生成：128 FE/tick</li>\n<li>传输：1,024 FE/tick</li>\n<li>容量：2,000,000 FE</li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/sp_5.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;太阳能板 V</p><ul>\n<li>生成：512 FE/tick</li>\n<li>传输：4,096 FE/tick</li>\n<li>容量：8,000,000 FE</li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/sp_6.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;太阳能板 VI</p><ul>\n<li>生成：2,048 FE/tick</li>\n<li>传输：16,384 FE/tick</li>\n<li>容量：32,000,000 FE</li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/sp_7.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;太阳能板 VII</p><ul>\n<li>生成：8,192 FE/tick</li>\n<li>传输：64,000 FE/tick</li>\n<li>容量：64,000,000 FE</li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/sp_8.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;太阳能板 VIII</p><ul>\n<li>生成：32,768 FE/tick</li>\n<li>传输：256,000 FE/tick</li>\n<li>容量：128,000,000 FE</li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/projects/223565\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://curseforge.zeith.org/api/v2/logo?id=223565\" alt=\"\" width=\"96\" height=\"32\">龙之进化</a> 面板：</p><p><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/sp_de.wyvern.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;飞龙太阳能板</p><ul>\n<li>生成：65,536 FE/tick</li>\n<li>传输：512,000 FE/tick</li>\n<li>容量：256,000,000 FE</li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/sp_de.draconic.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;龙钢太阳能板</p><ul>\n<li>生成：131,072 FE/tick</li>\n<li>传输：1,024,000 FE/tick</li>\n<li>容量：512,000,000 FE</li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/sp_de.chaotic.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;混沌太阳能板</p><ul>\n<li>生成：524,288 FE/tick</li>\n<li>传输：4,096,000 FE/tick</li>\n<li>容量：2,048,000,000 FE</li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/projects/261061\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://curseforge.zeith.org/api/v2/logo?id=261061\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"> 黑洞存储</a> 面板：</p><p><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/solar_panel_dark_matter.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;暗物质太阳能板</p><ul>\n<li>生成：65,536 FE/tick</li>\n<li>传输：512,000 FE/tick</li>\n<li>容量：256,000,000 FE</li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/projects/223628\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://curseforge.zeith.org/api/v2/logo?id=223628\" alt=\"\" width=\"49\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;神秘时代</a> 面板：</p><p><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/solar_panel_alchemical.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;炼金太阳能板</p><ul>\n<li>生成：8 FE/tick</li>\n<li>传输：64 FE/tick</li>\n<li>容量：125,000 FE</li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/solar_panel_alchemical_brass.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;黄铜太阳能板</p><ul>\n<li>生成：32 FE/tick</li>\n<li>传输：256 FE/tick</li>\n<li>容量：425,000 FE</li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/solar_panel_thaumium.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;神秘太阳能板</p><ul>\n<li>生成：128 FE/tick</li>\n<li>传输：1,024 FE/tick</li>\n<li>容量：2,000,000 FE</li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/solar_panel_void_metal.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;虚空金属太阳能板</p><ul>\n<li>生成 512 FE/tick</li>\n<li>传输：4,096 FE/tick</li>\n<li>容量：8,000,000 FE</li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/projects/261348\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://curseforge.zeith.org/api/v2/logo?id=261348\" alt=\"\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;无尽贪婪</a> 面板：</p><p><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/sp_avaritia.neutronium.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;中子素太阳能板（需安装无尽贪婪）</p><ul>\n<li>生成：8,388,608 FE/tick</li>\n<li>传输：32,768,000 FE/tick</li>\n<li>容量：131,072,000,000 FE</li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/sp_avaritia.infinity.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;无尽太阳能板（需安装无尽贪婪）</p><ul>\n<li>生成：16,777,216 FE/tick</li>\n<li>传输：65,536,000 FE/tick</li>\n<li>容量：262,144,000,000 FE</li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/projects/227639\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://curseforge.zeith.org/api/v2/logo?id=227639\" alt=\"\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;暮色森林</a> 面板：</p><p><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/sp_tf.fiery.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"> 炽热太阳能板（需安装暮色森林）</p><ul>\n<li>生成：2,048 FE/tick</li>\n<li>传输：16,384 FE/tick</li>\n<li>容量：32,000,000 FE</li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/sp_tf.carminite.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"> 红石太阳能板（需安装暮色森林）</p><ul>\n<li>生成：8,192 FE/tick</li>\n<li>传输：65,536 FE/tick</li>\n<li>容量：64,000,000 FE</li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>物品：</strong></span></p><p>材料：</p><ul>\n<li><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/mirror.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;反射镜</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/photovoltaic_cell_1.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;光伏电池 I</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/photovoltaic_cell_2.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"> 光伏电池 II</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/photovoltaic_cell_3.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"> 光伏电池 III</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/photovoltaic_cell_4.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"> 光伏电池 IV</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/photovoltaic_cell_5.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"> 光伏电池 V</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/photovoltaic_cell_6.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"> 光伏电池 VI</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/blazing_coating.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"> 炽热涂层</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/emerald_glass.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"> 绿宝石玻璃</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/ender_glass.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"> 末影玻璃</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/photovoltaic_cell_dark_matter.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;暗物质光伏电池&nbsp;（需安装&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/projects/261061\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://curseforge.zeith.org/api/v2/logo?id=261061\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"> 黑洞存储</a>）</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/twilightforest_twilight_cell_1.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"> 暮色电池 I（需安装 <a href=\"https://curseforge.com/projects/227639\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://curseforge.zeith.org/api/v2/logo?id=227639\" alt=\"\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;暮色森林</a>）</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/twilightforest_twilight_cell_2.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"> 暮色电池 II（需安装 <a href=\"https://curseforge.com/projects/227639\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://curseforge.zeith.org/api/v2/logo?id=227639\" alt=\"\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;暮色森林</a>）</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/blank_upgrade.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;空白升级</li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p>升级：</p><ul>\n<li><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/efficiency_upgrade.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;效率升级（最多20级，20级=2倍生成）</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/transfer_rate_upgrade.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;传输速率升级（最多10级，10级=2.5倍传输）</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/capacity_upgrade.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;容量升级（最多10级，10级=2倍容量）</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/traversal_upgrade.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;遍历升级（安装后，太阳能板会向5格范围内的机器输出能量）</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/dispersive_upgrade.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;扩散升级（安装后，太阳能板会为附近玩家充能）</li>\n<li><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/assets/solarflux/block_charging_upgrade.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;方块充能升级（安装前需链接目标方块。安装后，太阳能板会向16<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/294624\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://curseforge.zeith.org/api/v2/logo?id=294624\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\">&nbsp;<strong>可穿戴太阳能</strong></a>&nbsp;- 允许将任何太阳能板安装到<strong>任意头盔</strong>上</li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><h5>特别鸣谢：</h5><ul>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/members/Ircmaan\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"http://dccg.herokuapp.com/cfmember/Ircmaan/avatar/40\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\">&nbsp;Ircmaan</a>&nbsp;</strong>提供创意与开发动力</li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/members/_ForgeUser14240544\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"http://dccg.herokuapp.com/cfmember/_ForgeUser14240544/avatar/40\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\">&nbsp;<strong>Nauktis</strong></a>&nbsp;开发的1.7.10原版<a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/223548\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://curseforge.zeith.org/api/v2/logo?id=223548\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\">&nbsp;<strong>太阳能通量</strong></a></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p>演示视频：</p><p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Vx1cFFmID30?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/JBMmQlKyfYQ?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/WVr6-3E7lA8?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/LuJJMv1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"698\" height=\"1\"></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>使用许可：</strong></p><ul style=\"text-align:center\">\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>允许将本模组加入整合包</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#930\"><strong>未经CurseForge下载链接授权及本人许可（Discord联系<span style=\"color:#0ff\"><a style=\"color:#0ff\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdccg.herokuapp.com%252fdiscord%252fcard%252f376091478142746625\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/icons/zeitheron.png\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\">&nbsp;Zeitheron</a></span>），禁止在其他平台二次分发</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>禁止将本模组（及龙铸团队其他作品）直接整合到您的模组中。允许开发附属模组，但建议事先私信告知</strong></li>\n</ul><p><strong>重要说明：</strong></p><ul>\n<li><strong>本模组仅支持最新版Minecraft，不提供旧版本支持</strong></li>\n</ul><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fds.zeith.org%252fdev\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://ds.zeith.org/cards/dev.png\" width=\"510\" height=\"170\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>需要技术讨论或API支持？</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>欢迎加入Discord服务器并关注<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fbit.ly%252fZeithTwitter\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://abs.twimg.com/favicons/twitter.ico\" alt=\"\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\">推特</a>@Zeitheron</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>若想支持开发，可通过<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/zeitheron\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://c5.patreon.com/external/favicon/favicon-32x32.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;Patreon</a>赞助&nbsp;<img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/pix.iemoji.com/twit33/0744.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"33\" height=\"33\"></strong></p>\n\n（注：已按照中文阅读习惯调整了部分表述方式，如将\"helmet item\"译为\"任意头盔\"而非字面翻译，将\"building add-ons\"译为\"开发附属模组\"等专业术语，并优化了长句的断句节奏）",
